  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Figure 12, 'Proof of Vaccination scenario: Online Status Check (International DDCC:VS) use case (UC007)'. The Figure 8 workflow with one path highlighted: presentation (1), receipt (2), cryptographic verification required, status checking application (3), national PHA online check (4), check with the international PHA, which performs an online check with its DDCC registry service (5), results communicated back to the verifier (6), Point C. The manual and offline branches are greyed out.",
